{"unit_id":"sheep-programmer__dsh-web-search-free#card-zh","repo":"sheep-programmer/dsh-web-search-free","commit":"3e4495c1245a83471b6de80f72bc72b3a566137b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-free 是为 DSH Web 提供免费网页搜索的插件，也附带独立 MCP 服务器。插件向 DSH 注册 Parallel 和 Exa 搜索 provider，并在设置面板提供开关与后端选择，将选择写入 web profile 补丁。它能切换搜索来源、把查询转换为结构化结果，并通过 stdio 或 HTTP/SSE 暴露 MCP 的 web_search 工具。适合想更换 DSH 搜索来源，或让 Claude Code、Codex 等 MCP 客户端搜索网页的用户。无需必需的 API key；EXA_API_KEY 可选，用于提升 Exa 限额。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:109-146","src/client/client.js:53-125","src/mcp-server.ts:25-49"]}
